OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies abortion clinic
OL,4,Abuffer zone charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has entered fresh not guilty
OL,7,Fpleas at a court hearing, after being
OL,8,Faccused of silently praying outside an
OL,9,Fabortion clinic in Birmingham.
OL,11,FIsabel Vaughan-Spruce, from Malvern in
OL,12,FWorcestershire, denied five charges at
OL,13,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FProsecutors successfully argued that
OL,17,Fthere should be individual offences for
OL,18,Ffive separate alleged breaches of the
OL,19,FPublic Order Act, relating to a zone
OL,20,Faround a clinic in the Kings Norton
OL,21,Farea of the city.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
