OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies abortion clinic
OL,4,Abuffer zone charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 49-year-old was the first person in
OL,7,FEngland and Wales to be charged under
OL,8,Fnew "buffer zone" legislation which
OL,9,Fcame into force in October 2024 and
OL,10,Frestricts some activities near abortion
OL,11,Ffacilities.
